<% if @company_name.present? -%>
Hello <%= @company_name %>,
<% else -%>
Hello,
<% end -%>

We've moved our wholesale ordering to a new portal. Your account and order
history have already been set up for you -- you just need to choose a password.

Click the link below to finish setting up your account:

<%= @claim_url %>

This link is valid for <%= @expires_in_days %> days. If it expires, just request a
new one at <%= @retry_url %> and we'll send another.

If the link doesn't work, copy and paste it into your browser's address bar.

If you weren't expecting this email, you can safely ignore it -- no changes
will be made to your account.

--
<%= @store.name %>
